    "description": "<p>You cause a creature to grow razor-sharp claws and teeth.</p><p>Choose yourself or a creature within <strong>10 spaces</strong>.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, the target gains the below attack:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Claws and Fangs</strong>: Melee, 4 + ES Damage, Magical, Piercing, Rend, Flurry</p></li></ul><p>Additionally, the target gains a <strong>+1 dice bonus</strong> to any <strong>Climb</strong> checks.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.B36HexVAs9SFAwij]{Claws and Fangs}</p>",
